{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"「TEPPEN」見てくだった方、ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優勝はできませんでしたー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、審査員の方や司会の方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントや今日の握手でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのみなさんに、「楽しかった」って言ってもらえて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが第一の目標だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくうれしかったです(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～終わってホッとしたぁ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュディマリさんの「そばかす」を弾きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな曲なので、純粋にみなさんにも楽しく聞いてほしいな～って♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2014/01/06/0000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対決したみなさんと☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に優しくて、みんないい方でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ緊張を味わったからこそ、終わったあとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐっと距離が近くなった気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出番が終わった直後は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「終わったね～よかったね～」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HKT48の森保まどかちゃんに抱きついちゃいました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48の松井咲子さんとも仲良くお話させてもらうようになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優勝おめでとうございますっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2014/01/06/0001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2014/01/05/2925013/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は出ることに迷いもあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにいい経験をさせてもらったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋で、今年始めての握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの温かい言葉にヽ(●'v`)ﾉﾙﾝﾀｯﾀ♪でしたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日6日の19時～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日テレの音楽番組「カヴァコラ」生放送に出演します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}